{
  "info": {
    "name": "BTNG 2026 - Task API",
    "description": "Collection Pertemuan 5 & 6.\n\nP5: CRUD utuh + validasi (PUT/PATCH/DELETE, store() ber-validate).\nP6: format respons seragam 'message + data' lewat TaskResource.\n\nCara pakai:\n1. jalankan `php artisan serve` (default http://127.0.0.1:8000)\n2. import collection ini + environment 'BTNG 2026 - Local'\n3. pilih environment, lalu jalankan request (atau Collection Runner).\n\nSetiap request memakai header `Accept: application/json` dan menyimpan assertion bahwa respons selalu punya key `message`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "P06 - Tujuh request (pola message + data)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. POST /tasks (store) -> 201",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "pm.test('selalu ada message', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('message'); });",
                  "pm.test('message: Task berhasil dibuat', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('Task berhasil dibuat'); });",
                  "pm.test('ada data task baru', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.have.property('id'); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('task_id', pm.response.json().data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Belajar API Resource\",\n    \"description\": \"Format JSON seragam\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tasks"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. GET /tasks (index) -> 200",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('selalu ada message', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('message'); });",
                  "pm.test('message: Daftar task berhasil diambil', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('Daftar task berhasil diambil'); });",
                  "pm.test('data berupa array', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.be.an('array'); });",
                  "pm.test('is_completed bertipe boolean', function () {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  if (d.length) { pm.expect(d[0].is_completed).to.be.a('boolean'); }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tasks",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tasks"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. GET /tasks/1 (show) -> 200",
          "event": [
